            "review_title": "Review at Van Hoa Restaurant",
            "review_text": "BMY\nBerkeley, California8 contributions\n0\nTerrible, Over-Rate, The Worst in HCM City!!!\nMar 2023\nThe worst service I ever received in the country. Waitresses walked on moon and constantly made mistakes but did not admit their own mistakes. Charged everything, even stale peanuts that you don't want and those cheap packets of wet towels. Food was just ok and honestly did not worth the money. Your dollars can be spent much more and much better anywhere else in the city!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 1, 2023",
